WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.606
This is the free, single-device CJ POS app.

2
00:00:04.156 --> 00:00:06.028
Open the Android app and start an order.

3
00:00:06.357 --> 00:00:08.467
Choose English, Chinese or Malay.

4
00:00:09.087 --> 00:00:12.216
Staff select items, serving sizes and add-ons.

5
00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:17.541
In Edit, change the shop name, menu, photos and prices, then save.

6
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:20.508
Open Customer View and let customers choose.

7
00:00:21.095 --> 00:00:25.088
After checking and submitting the order, they hand the same phone back to staff.

8
00:00:25.523 --> 00:00:28.690
This app does not automatically sync orders between two phones.

9
00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:30.106
Orders go to Kitchen.

10
00:00:30.535 --> 00:00:32.200
Payment and preparation are separate.

11
00:00:32.838 --> 00:00:37.088
Once the food is ready, an unpaid order stays in Payments, ready for collection.

12
00:00:37.502 --> 00:00:42.081
For cash or QR, check the amount and confirm only after receiving the money.

13
00:00:42.539 --> 00:00:45.727
Scanning a QR code does not confirm payment automatically.

14
00:00:46.356 --> 00:00:51.009
In History, export Excel reports by day, week, month or year.

15
00:00:51.585 --> 00:00:53.728
On Android, choose a report folder.

16
00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.929
Daily reports save automatically while the app is open.

17
00:00:57.377 --> 00:00:58.998
Records stay on this device.

18
00:00:59.449 --> 00:01:02.368
Before changing phones, export a full backup.

19
00:01:03.076 --> 00:01:05.360
Now try a complete order with the sample menu.
